OL,3,GNEWSACouncil accused of ignoring
OL,4,Ahousing shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA housebuilder has accused a council of
OL,7,F"doing nothing" to meet a housing
OL,8,Fshortage in a public inquiry into a
OL,9,Frejected proposal for 600 homes.
OL,11,FIn March, Stockton Council's planning
OL,12,Fcommittee rejected Taylor Wimpey's
OL,13,F#133m plan for land east of
OL,14,FHoldenfields Farm in Yarm but the
OL,15,Fdevelopers appealed against the
OL,16,Fdecision to the Planning Inspectorate.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
