OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil accused of ignoring
OL,4,Ahousing shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FSasha White KC, representing the
OL,7,Fdeveloper, said the council showed a
OL,8,F"complete disregard" for government
OL,9,Fpolicy, adding it had "literally for 30
OL,10,Fmonths done nothing" to move forward a
OL,11,Fnew Local Plan.
OL,13,FThe council previously told the inquiry
OL,14,Fthe proposal is "unsustainable"
OL,15,Fhighlighting traffic issues and limited
OL,16,Fcapacity to provide an electrical
OL,17,Fsupply.
